@baseUrl = https://localhost:7295
@accessToken = THAY_BANG_JWT
@propertyId = THAY_BANG_GUID_TIN_DANG

### 1. Them nha dang cong khai vao yeu thich
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/favorites/{{propertyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Gui lai request (idempotent, khong tao ban ghi trung)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/favorites/{{propertyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. Xem danh sach nha yeu thich, phan trang server-side
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/favorites?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Kiem tra mot tin da duoc yeu thich chua
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/favorites/{{propertyId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Bo yeu thich (goi lap lai van an toan)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/favorites/{{propertyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Kiem tra page khong hop le (mong doi 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/favorites?page=0&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Kiem tra pageSize vuot gioi han (mong doi 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/favorites?page=1&pageSize=51
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
